{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 28, :comments ["<b>It and its offspring.</b> This applies to the female — it is forbidden to slaughter the mother and the son or the daughter, and it does not apply to males, and it is permitted to slaughter the father and the son (ibid. 78)." "<b>It and its offspring.</b> 'Its offspring and it' is also included in the meaning (ibid. ch. 2)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:07:47.481159019Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}